 class=\"v-m\">黎明；拂晓；天亮</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209818\">その<ruby>事故<rp>(</rp><rt>じこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>明<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>がた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>こった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">事故发生在黎明</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">挙げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">列举；例举；显示；展示；引用；鼓起；汇聚；聚集；逮捕；捉拿；抓获；拘捕；提名；推荐；提议；建议；举办；举行；进行；主持；起义；举兵；武装反抗；公布；宣扬；传播；成名；生育；生养；抚养；养育；抬起；举起；提高；升高；发出；提高；扬起（嗓音）；赢得；获得；取得；达到</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149532\"><ruby>質問<rp>(</rp><rt>しつもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があれば<ruby>右手<rp>(</rp><rt>みぎて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>挙<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げて<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果有问题，请举起你的右手。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/344199\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">揚げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">油炸；炸（食物）；燃放（烟火等）；升起（旗等）；放（风筝）；放飞；召唤；传唤（艺妓等）；靠岸；上岸；移上陆地；吸收；吸取（水等）；汲取</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112044\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はたこを<ruby>揚<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他飞风筝。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">憧れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あこがれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">憧憬；向往；渴望；仰慕；敬仰</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230690\">あの<ruby>人達<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとたち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>都会<rp>(</rp><rt>とかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>生活<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあこがれている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们渴望城市生活。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">足跡</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あしあと</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">足迹；脚印；访问记录；浏览足迹</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"139777\"><ruby>足跡<rp>(</rp><rt>あしあと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>床<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>残<rp>(</rp><rt>のこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">脚印留在地板上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">味わう</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あじわう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">品尝；品味；细细品尝；欣赏；享受；体会；领略；经历；体验；尝试</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231304\">あのテーマパークでスリルを<ruby>味<rp>(</rp><rt>あじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们在主题公园玩得很开心</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">預かる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あずかる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">保管；照看；代为看管；保存；被委托；被赋予责任；被委以重任；暂缓（宣布）；保留（判断）；留待决定；自行承担；自己处理</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"235201\">４<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>荷物<rp>(</rp><rt>にもつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>預<rp>(</rp><rt>あず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かっていただけませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你能把我的包放在这直到四点吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暖まる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あたたまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变暖；暖和；温暖起来；晒太阳取暖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127293\"><ruby>暖<rp>(</rp><rt>あたた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まるまでエンジンをかけておきなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">运行引擎,直到它变暖。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暖める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あたためる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">加热；温热；酝酿；珍藏（想法等）；反复思考；重续；重新恢复（旧友谊）；据为己有；自己占有</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195031\">ミルクを<ruby>温<rp>(</rp><rt>あたた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めてくれませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你能把牛奶热一下吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あたりまえ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\